    <string name="get_started">Get started</string>
    <string name="already_used_gymflow">Already used GymFlow?</string>
    <string name="intro_headline">Your workout — from the first set to a new record.</string>
    <string name="intro_why_title">Everything that matters for progress, in one place</string>
    <string name="intro_summary">Set up GymFlow once: choose where and when you train, your goals and available equipment. From there, the app helps you manage your program, sets and rest, nutrition, measurements, records and history without unnecessary clutter.</string>
    <string name="intro_training_title">Training built around you</string>
    <string name="intro_training_text">Gym or home, dumbbells or a pull-up bar — GymFlow uses your setup, selected days and program. Exercises can be configured by day, replaced and reordered.</string>
    <string name="intro_workout_title">What you need during a workout</string>
    <string name="intro_workout_text">Technique, target muscles, common mistakes and the current set stay in view. Finish a set with a swipe, rest on the timer and move forward one step at a time.</string>
    <string name="intro_set_preview">Set 2 of 4 • 60 kg × 10</string>
    <string name="intro_progress_title">Progress, goals and records</string>
    <string name="intro_progress_text">Save body measurements, workout history and personal records. Create your own goals and review muscle load across recent weeks.</string>
    <string name="intro_nutrition_title">Nutrition without complicated tables</string>
    <string name="intro_nutrition_text">Set daily targets for protein, calories and water. Quick controls make logging easy through the day, while progress shows how much remains.</string>
    <string name="intro_music_title">Your music during training</string>
    <string name="intro_music_text">Import tracks from your device and control playback with the Mini Player, queue, seek, shuffle and repeat. Music can continue while you move into a workout.</string>
    <string name="intro_reminders_title">Reminders you can control</string>
    <string name="intro_reminders_text">GymFlow can remind you about training, protein and new measurements, and occasionally show a short motivation message. Each notification type can be disabled separately.</string>
    <string name="intro_data_title">Take your data with you</string>
    <string name="intro_data_text">Your profile, program, nutrition, measurements, goals, records, history and settings are stored locally and can be moved using Import / Export backups.</string>
    <string name="intro_local_storage_badge">Local data</string>
    <string name="intro_personalize_title">Make the interface yours</string>
    <string name="intro_personalize_text">Russian and English, light, dark or system theme, multiple color palettes and adjustable text size let you tune GymFlow for everyday use.</string>
    <string name="intro_ready_title">Ready to start?</string>
    <string name="intro_ready_text">Answer a few questions and GymFlow will prepare a schedule and program around your choices. You can change everything later.</string>
    <string name="mini_player">Mini Player</string>
    <string name="telegram">Telegram</string>
    <string name="telegram_gymflow">GymFlow</string>
    <string name="terms_full_text">GymFlow helps you track workouts, nutrition, measurements, goals and progress history. You choose your own training loads, exercises and daily targets and are responsible for making sure they are appropriate for your condition and experience. GymFlow is not a medical service and is not intended to diagnose or treat medical conditions. If an exercise causes pain, dizziness or significant discomfort, stop and seek professional guidance when appropriate. By using the app, you agree to use its features responsibly and in accordance with the laws that apply to you.</string>
    <string name="privacy_full_text">Core GymFlow data is stored locally on your device. This may include your profile, date of birth, body measurements, workout schedule and history, nutrition, goals, records, settings and links to music files you selected. GymFlow does not upload this data to its own cloud service. Backups are exported only when you request them. Audio files are not embedded in the JSON backup. You can remove GymFlow data with Reset in Settings; original music files on your device are not deleted.</string>

